1.3.2 Narrative: Why These Objectives Matter

The modernization initiative enables the retail organization to transition from fragmented reporting and legacy ETL limitations to a scalable cloud-based analytics ecosystem. Centralizing data into ADLS Gen2 creates a single source of truth across sales, inventory, and customer domains.

Automated ADF pipelines reduce manual intervention and improve operational reliability, while Databricks transformations ensure high-quality curated datasets. Governance through RBAC and Key Vault improves security compliance and operational control.

Ultimately, the project empowers business stakeholders with faster reporting, improved inventory visibility, enhanced customer analytics, and scalable enterprise-grade data engineering capabilities.
